ばシニカルな発言をする皮肉屋な一面がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分自身を好きになれず、他人を信用することも出来ないため、孤独感を深めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしながら、その美貌に学園内の女の子たちからは憧れの存在になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から一貫して変わらぬ態度で接してくれる操にのみ心を許しており、口にこそ出さないが大事に思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家への反発と自立を目的として、学園公認のもとにモデルをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「別に、私は仲良くなど……。担任にそう言われたとしたら、役目を果たすだけだ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16694"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"170 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20470","sourceWorkId":"15143","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb817ac695a28483e81bd28f7277a72d3670633018d3a9c463b1ec2baa89bab1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be1ec3050a0a518c6fc54c04a0f9017534406bfaf136e0d7c14c7be0a1fb9630.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田口宏子","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13213:16694:5020:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c3641","characterName":"実蒔 希","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16695","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"13213"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20471"],"vndbCharacterId":"c3641"},"originalCharacterName":"実蒔 希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"157"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nozomi is a transfer student to Hayato’s class and she’s also the granddaughter of the 